BT /F1 11 Tf 15 TL 40 740 Td (Joining the garden) Tj T* () Tj T* (Fernlea Community Garden is run by its members. Membership costs 18 pounds a) Tj T* (year and is paid at the March meeting. The garden has 42 plots. Plot rentals) Tj T* (start on 1 March each year. At the moment 9 households are on the waiting list,) Tj T* (and a plot is offered to the household that has waited longest.) Tj ET
