BT /F1 11 Tf 15 TL 40 740 Td (Working the plots) Tj T* () Tj T* (The tool shed is open from 09:00 to 18:00 every day. The garden has 4 compost) Tj T* (bins, and kitchen scraps may only go into the green bin. The water butts are) Tj T* (refilled every Sunday by the volunteer on the rota. Bonfires are not allowed) Tj T* (anywhere on the site.) Tj ET
